            <div xml:id="d774">

                <pb facs="1058" n="932" sameAs="frus:frus1925v01/pg932"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.74/623: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase—Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-10-08T23:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 8,
                                1925—11 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received October 8—4:35
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>430. My 426, October 5, 11 a.m.</p>
                <p>1. This evening notes were exchanged and the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >procès-verbal</hi> was initialed. These were outlined in telegram under
                    reference. The Chinese note is dated October 6.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
